# Review routing for high-blast-radius paths (#751).
#
# This file is intended only to route review requests; it is not a security
# boundary. Whether code-owner approval is ever required on main is a separate
# repository-settings decision (see #751). Paths not listed here have no
# special owner: ordinary source, tests, docs and examples follow the normal
# review flow without waiting on a code owner.

